layout: policy.njk
title: "Problem & Solution options: Sage"
description: Five dot-matrix animations for the band over The Problem & The Solution, in place of the untangling lines.
noindex: true
permalink: /concepts/problem/
options:
  - id: signal
    tag: 01 · Recommended
    name: Noise to signal
    desc: One field of dots across the band. Over the challenge they're scattered and restless, grey, drifting about; over the solution they've fallen into a perfect grid in the purples. As you scroll, the order spreads leftwards and the scatter calms, so the section reads chaos to clarity in the hero's own grid.
  - id: knot
    tag: 02 · The same idea, in dots
    name: Dotted knot
    desc: Today's untangling band, kept, but drawn in dots. Lines of dots knot and writhe over the challenge and run straight and violet over the solution, and scrolling unties them.
  - id: static
    tag: 03 · Resolve
    name: Static to tick
    desc: Over the challenge the dots flicker like a screen of static. As you scroll, the flicker stops from the right, dot by dot, and the settled dots resolve into a large tick in the purples over the solution.
  - id: funnel
    tag: 04 · Many into one
    name: Many into one
    desc: Scattered dots, every tool and tab and loose end, stream in from the left, wandering, and gather into one bright point over the solution, which pulses as they arrive; out of it runs a single clean line. Scrolling tightens the stream.
  - id: eq
    tag: 05 · Growth
    name: Steadying meter
    desc: A row of dot columns like an equalizer. Over the challenge they jump about at random; over the solution they settle into a steady rising ramp, echoing the staircase above. As you scroll, the steadiness spreads leftwards.
---
{# Ways to animate the band over The Problem & The Solution (section 02, home-sections.njk) in the
   dot-matrix hero's language, in place of the untangling lines (scripts.njk, 9). Each option is
   the real heading, band and columns. Everything is scoped under .pb- #}

<style>
  .pb-intro { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 24px var(--gutter); padding: 20px 0 40px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .pb-intro > div { grid-column: 2 / -1; }
  .pb-intro h1 { font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 5.5rem); font-weight: 500; line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -0.05em; }
  .pb-intro p { margin-top: 20px; max-width: 60ch; font-size: clamp(1.0625rem, 1.2vw, 1.375rem); line-height: 1.55; color: var(--ink-2); }
  .pb-jump { position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 30; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px 22px; padding: 14px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--bg) 90%, transparent); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px); backdrop-filter: blur(12px); list-style: none; font-size: 0.875rem; }
  .pb-jump a { color: var(--ink-2); }
  .pb-jump b { margin-right: 6px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--accent-soft); }
  .pb-option { padding: clamp(80px, 10vw, 140px) 0 clamp(60px, 8vw, 120px); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); scroll-margin-top: 50px; }
  .pb-cap { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 16px var(--gutter); margin-bottom: clamp(48px, 6vw, 96px); padding: 18px 20px; border-radius: 14px; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent-2) 7%, transparent); }
  .pb-cap > p:first-child { font-size: 0.8125rem; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--accent-soft); }
  .pb-cap > p:last-child { grid-column: 2 / -1; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--ink-2); }
  .pb-cap b { display: block; margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 1.375rem; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -0.03em; color: var(--ink); }
  .pb-option .section-head { margin-bottom: clamp(40px, 5vw, 80px); }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .pb-intro, .pb-cap { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .pb-intro > div, .pb-cap > p:last-child { grid-column: 1; }
  }
</style>

<header class="pb-intro">
